    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1951-p12.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "At \\(2{:}15\\) the minute hand is \\(90^\\circ\\) from \\(12.\\) The hour hand is \\(2\\cdot30^\\circ+15\\cdot0.5^\\circ=67.5^\\circ\\) from \\(12.\\) Their angle is \\(90^\\circ-67.5^\\circ=22.5^\\circ=22\\dfrac12^\\circ.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
      "hints": [
        "At \\(2{:}15\\) the minute hand is at \\(90^\\circ\\) from \\(12\\)",
        "The hour hand moves \\(0.5^\\circ\\) per minute in addition to its position at \\(2{:}00\\)"
      ],
